{
 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.26,
   "text": "If you're not using cloud right now, you're probably falling behind."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.52,
   "end": 4.88,
   "text": "The creator of cloud even said that AI is about to create a wealth cap bigger"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.88,
   "end": 6.28,
   "text": "than anything we've ever seen before."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.76,
   "end": 7.18,
   "text": "And don't worry."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.34,
   "end": 8.94,
   "text": "It's not too late to catch up because here are the exact"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.94,
   "end": 10.36,
   "text": "resources to not get left behind."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.74,
   "end": 12.12,
   "text": "First is Anthopics free course library."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.44,
   "end": 14.8,
   "text": "They basically made free classes to teach you how to use their own AI."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.9,
   "end": 16.14,
   "text": "So there's no reason not to learn."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.48,
   "end": 17.92,
   "text": "Next is Anthopics official skills plugins."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.26,
   "end": 19.06,
   "text": "These are basically cheat codes."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.18,
   "end": 21.58,
   "text": "You can plug into cloud code to make it instantly better at specific tasks."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.86,
   "end": 23.7,
   "text": "Finally, there's this repo called awesome cloud code sub-agents."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.08,
   "end": 25.78,
   "text": "This is a free collection of over a hundred cloud code"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.78,
   "end": 26.7,
   "text": "helpers built by the community."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.16,
   "end": 27.74,
   "text": "Think of them like apps."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.84,
   "end": 29.22,
   "text": "You can add to cloud to make it do more things."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.22,
   "end": 31.56,
   "text": "And you do not want to be left behind when it comes to AI and cloud"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.56,
   "end": 33.02,
   "text": "is arguably the best AI right now."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.38,
   "end": 34.9,
   "text": "Follow and comment cloud for all the links I mentioned."
  }
 ],
